Dict{"step_by_step_thinking": "The patient is a 30-year-old woman who has been unable to conceive for 3 years, despite her husband having normal semen analysis. She also reports episodic pelvic and back pain accompanied by painful diarrhea for 5 years. The patient has regular menstrual cycles and normal pelvic and bimanual examinations. A hysterosalpingogram 6 months prior showed normal results. 

